</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>z</mi></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Then, we find the natural logarithm <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"4\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mrow><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6C\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-mrow></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">(</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">)</mo></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> of both sides of the equation and solve for <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"5\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D467 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"BIN\"><mo>:</mo></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"6\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-m